Scope and third-party material notice

The MIT License above applies to original server code, Flutter client code,
tools and documentation created by OpenCoK contributors
that they own or have authority to license under MIT. Third-party components
retain their own licenses and notices. Modifying, extracting, converting or
packaging third-party material does not bring that material under this grant.

OpenCoK is an independent Clash of Kings mod with an open-source server and
a progressively developed Flutter client for Android, iOS, Linux, Windows
and Web. OpenCoK develops its own gameplay client. The Elex client serves
only as a reference for analysis, not as a supported client or runtime
dependency of the project.

OpenCoK does not distribute Clash of Kings assets, artwork, audio, text, data,
binaries, trademarks or other proprietary material. The original Elex client
