resources are excluded from the MIT license grant above. Such material remains
the property of its respective rights holders. Users who choose to supply external assets are solely
responsible for obtaining them lawfully and ensuring that they have permission
from the applicable rights holder or another valid legal basis to use them.

OpenCoK contributors do not claim ownership of Clash of Kings or its assets.
The project is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Elex or the
original game's other rights holders. This notice grants no rights to their
proprietary source code, servers or confidential material.

Rights holders may request review or removal of material by opening an issue
or contacting the repository maintainers through the contact method published
